# Line endings — LF in the index AND in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# The index is already all-LF; without this file a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks the
# tree out as CRLF, and `node scripts/release.mjs` rewrites README.md via `lines.join('\n')` — turning
# a one-token version bump into a whole-file diff. Markdown IS the product here, so its bytes are kept
# identical everywhere rather than left to each contributor's git config.
* text=auto eol=lf
